# MediaPipe runtime assets (Phase 5B). Regenerated by `npm run setup:mediapipe`,
# which runs automatically before `dev` and `build`: the wasm is copied out of the
# pinned node_modules package and the model is fetched once against a pinned
# SHA-256. ~26MB of binaries that the lockfile and that digest already pin
# exactly, so committing them would add weight without adding reproducibility.
public/mediapipe/

# Pyodide runtime (Phase 7). Copied out of the pinned node_modules package by
# `npm run setup:pyodide`, which runs before dev and build. ~13MB the lockfile
# already pins exactly, so committing it would add weight without reproducibility.
public/pyodide/
